@startuml scope-firewall-state
' Copyright (c) 2026 BY-SYSTEMS SRL. MIT License.
[*] --> Absent

Absent --> Created : ensure("present")
Created --> Staged : API accepts
Staged --> Applied : reconfigure/apply
Applied --> Updated : ensure("present", changed params)
Updated --> Applied : reconfigure/apply
Applied --> Deleted : ensure("absent")
Deleted --> Absent : cleanup

state Created {
  [*] --> Disabled : enabled=0
  Disabled --> Enabled : update enabled=1
  Enabled --> Disabled : update enabled=0
}

note right of Staged
  Changes staged in OPNsense
  Not active until apply
end note

note right of Disabled
  Phase 2: always disabled
  Phase 3: enable for E2E
end note
@enduml
